  "description": "A testbed for the look, the sound and the play (docs/DYNAMIC_CAMPAIGN_TEST.md): battery 21 deployed on open ground at the capital's eastern edge, every kind of our air defence and radar within a few kilometres (an Osa battery that fights, a Kub, an S-75M2, an S-125M1, Strela-10 and Strela-1, Shilkas, ten S-60 batteries, KS-30s, ZU-23s, MANPADS teams; P-14, P-15, P-18, P-19, P-40, PRV-11), and random waves of every adversary's aircraft and our own coming in for four hours: strikes dropping their loads, SEAD with ARMs, jammers, decoys, helicopters, cruise missiles, AWACS and tankers on their orbits, our fighters on patrol. F12 visits every asset. Fictional; game values.",
